    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the game of 'My Little Kitty'  This pet development game allows you to play the role of the owner of a kitten, take care of it, train it, and play games with it. In this fun filled game, you need to do various<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet coins offline, and other methods to establish and raise your pet cat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy Little Kitty not only has cute and charming character images and delicate and smooth animations, but also rich gameplay and fun. You can interact and play with your kittens, feed them, dress up, and even ride cows, run parkour, and more. Each outfit has unique effects, such as feeding rewards, mobility, etc. You can gradually give your kitten unique traits and abilities, and earn more coins and rewards.",
